    NODO["🏛️ Nodo Provincial\n10.10.x.1"]

    T1 -->|HTTP| NGINX
    T2 -->|HTTP| NGINX
    T3 -->|HTTP| NGINX
    TB -->|USB| FLASK

    NGINX --> FLASK
